  "note": "The release lists the Weather Report Suite as a single 15:38 track and the corpus keeps it as three stripes. No tape settles this one — gd73-11-09.sbd.kaplan.2657.sbefail.shnf divides it 2:34 / 4:18 / 9:43, which is fifty-seven seconds *over* the release and gives the Prelude 2:34 against a corpus range of 1:11–1:35, so that transfer looks mistracked. Split by ear by Jason, 2026-08-18, with the remainder carried on Let It Grow so the three parts sum to the release's 15:38 exactly — the same place he has put it every other time."
